return {
    ["\n　　第十三个了，太爽了！太爽了！\n　　这金色子弹的效果太好了，有了它我还当什么雇佣杀手！\n　　不过那位先生的条件也够奇怪，不管目标是谁，只要在特定地点，特定时间杀……\n　　不管了，反正警察也不会真的抓我，他们说好了的！\n　　按照约定，明天晚上，一切就结束了。"] = "\n	The thirteenth one, so satisfying! So satisfying!\n	The effect of this golden Bullet is too good. With it, why would I still be a hired killer!\n	But that gentleman's conditions are strange enough; no matter who the target is, as long as it's at a specific location, at a specific time, kill...\n	Whatever, the police won't really catch me anyway; they promised!\n	According to the agreement, tomorrow night, everything will be finished.",
    ["         只是我遗留的一片扭曲的残念罢了，却自以为是斯蒂姆宫的主人？呵呵，但我的力量，又哪是那么好利用的。那只是我意志的一部分，被扭曲和污染的一部分，并不是真正的我……"] = "        It is just a piece of distorted remnant thought I left behind, yet it thinks it is the master of the Steam Palace? Heh, but my power is not so easily used. That is only a part of my will, a part that has been distorted and corrupted, not the real me...",
