    ["<Highlight>【规则说明】</>\n\n<Title>灵性之力</>\n1.邦尼洒下了灵性碎片，疯狂的抢夺吧。\n2.场地中央降下一道雷电特性，触碰即可暂时掌控雷电之力。\n3.使用雷电之力击败敌人即可获得大量灵性，但期间无法拾取其他任何灵性之力。\n<Title>收集灵性</>\n1.场地上还会四处飘浮着其他灵性光球，触碰可获得不同的能力。\n2.巧妙运用获得的技能与敌人周旋，同时尽可能收集更多的灵性碎片。\n3.有时候，拳头可能比灵性更好用。\n<Title>随机规则</>\n1.游戏共进行三轮，每轮仪式都会出现不同的规则。\n2.根据环境的变化调整你的策略，成为最终赢家！\n3.不努力的人可是得不到邦尼奖励的奥。"] = "<Highlight>【Rule Description】</>\n\n<Title>Spirituality Power</>\n1. Bonnie has scattered fragments of spirituality; scramble to grab them!\n2. A lightning attribute will descend in the center of the field; touch it to temporarily control the power of lightning.\n3. Use the power of lightning to defeat enemies to gain a large amount of spirituality, but you cannot pick up any other spirituality power during this time.\n<Title>Collecting Spirituality</>\n1. Other spiritual light orbs will float around the field; touch them to gain different abilities.\n2. Use the skills you've gained to maneuver around enemies while collecting as many spiritual fragments as possible.\n3. Sometimes, your fists might be more useful than spirituality.\n<Title>Random Rules</>\n1. The game consists of three rounds, and different rules will appear for each ritual.\n2. Adjust your strategy according to environmental changes and become the final winner!\n3. Those who don't put in the effort won't get Bonnie's rewards!",
